                                "sense_id": "f68d7042-e9e1-31bf-83e5-130c24f36a47",
                                "text": "He stayed not t’advize, which way were best\nHis foe t’assayle, or how himselfe to gard,\nBut with fierce fury and with force infest\nUpon him ran […]"
